        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of mince and tomato bolognese sauce",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the Gousto recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-7",
      "number": 7,
      "heading": "Toss the pasta",
      "blocks": [
        "Grate the lighter cheese. Stir the drained pasta through the thickened sauce until coated."
      ],
      "notes": [],
